shiki-go implements the native library and CLI functionality of Shiki 4.4.3.

This project includes Go translations of Shiki and vscode-textmate algorithms,
the upstream TextMate grammars and themes, the unmodified Oniguruma WebAssembly
binary, and HAST property metadata. It also reproduces behavior from Shiki's
transformers, colorized-brackets, stream, and CLI packages, hast-util-to-html,
property-information, stringify-entities, and ansis.

Shiki reference commit: 48cd2cc695ed2e3357c3f9c370578ea843d6d9a3
https://github.com/shikijs/shiki

